head red cabbage, shredded\n* ½ [[Cookbook:Cup|cup]] [[Cookbook:Mayonnaise|mayonnaise]]\n* ¼ cup apple [[Cookbook:Cider Vinegar|cider vinegar]]\n* ½ [[Cookbook:Teaspoon|tsp]] freshly-ground [[Cookbook:Celery Seed|celery seed]]\n* ¼ tsp freshly-ground [[Cookbook:Cumin|cumin]]\n* 1 tsp freshly-ground [[Cookbook:Coriander|coriander]]\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Tablespoon|tbsp]] dry [[Cookbook:Mustard|mustard]] powder\n* [[Cookbook:Salt|Salt]]\n\n== Procedure ==\n#[[Cookbook:Mixing#Tossing|Toss]] cabbage with a few big handfuls of kosher salt. Place in a [[Cookbook:Colander|colander]] in a bowl and let sit at room temperature 2 hours.\n#Drain cabbage. Rinse with clean water and let them go for a spin in your [[Cookbook:Salad Spinner|salad spinner]] until relatively dry.\n#Combine vinegar and spices. [[Cookbook:Microwave|Microwave]] on high until mixture comes to a [[Cookbook:Boiling|boil]].\n#[[Cookbook:Folding|Fold]] in mayonnaise and cabbage. Chill until cold.\n\n[[Category:Recipes for salad]]\n[[Category:Recipes using napa cabbage]]\n[[Category:Recipes using mayonnaise]]\n[[Category:Recipes using vinegar]]\n[[Category:Side dish recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes using celery seed]]\n[[Category:Recipes using coriander]]\n[[Category:Recipes using ground cumin]]\n[[Category:Recipes using mustard powder]]\n[[Category:Recipes using red cabbage]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Coleslaw II","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"¼ head napa cabbage, shredded","sourceText":"¼ head napa cabbage, shredded","amountText":"¼ head napa cabbage, shredded","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"¼ head red cabbage, shredded","sourceText":"¼ head red cabbage, shredded","amountText":"¼ head red cabbage, shredded","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-3","name":"½ cup mayonnaise","sourceText":"½ cup mayonnaise","amountText":"½ cup mayonnaise","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodB